  "details": "When using either video player (stream or videoplayer), not everyone is able to see YouTube videos, or possibly any videos at all. In watching something with 40 other people, around 8 people reported that they could see nothing playing on the screen at all. Rejoining, relaunching, and clearing their cache did absolutely nothing. I can not post my world link since it is not a public world, but this should be happening on other maps with video players assumingly, since I made no changes to mine.",
